      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When a drunk gambler grabs Katya's arm at the poker table, Barinov jumps to his daughter's defense and ends up with a black eye. Back at the hotel, a furious Eleonora brings in a psychologist to counsel Katya.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
